9a4ed51b51.mp4?t=1753088912\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cool Warbeast Designs</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Warbeasts you\u2019ll control aren\u2019t regular aliens. Hulking colossi, slender spellcasters, and feral killing machines will make up the core part of your team!\u200b<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3796970/extras/78e3d70b8a36066b3523a3f3ac8b0eb2.poster.avif?t=1753088912\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3796970/extras/78e3d70b8a36066b3523a3f3ac8b0eb2.webm?t=1753088912\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3796970/extras/78e3d70b8a36066b3523a3f3ac8b0eb2.mp4?t=1753088912\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Regular Updates &amp; Events</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay engaged with frequent content updates, balance patches, and themed events that introduce new cards and gameplay mechanics.\u200b<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3796970/extras/79cff5da6a31f13fa45b26e21876f7c3.poster.avif?t=1753088912\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3796970/extras/79cff5da6a31f13fa45b26e21876f7c3.webm?t=1753088912\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3796970/extras/79cff5da6a31f13fa45b26e21876f7c3.mp4?t=1753088912\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Starship Warbeasts stands out in the digital TCG landscape by offering a unique blend of easy mechanics and complex tactics. Being a great fit for newcomers and veterans of TCGs, the game allows all to express themselves on the battlefields in the way they see fit. Of course, you won\u2019t be alone, as Starship Warbeasts is an MMO and will have a huge community of passionate players!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Join a Thriving Community</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become part of a vibrant community of card game enthusiasts. Share strategies, discuss deck builds, and participate in community-driven tournaments. With Starship Warbeasts, you're not just playing a game\u2014you're joining a global community passionate about TCGs.\u200b</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Wishlist now!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wishlist Starship Warbeasts for free on Steam and embark on your path to becoming a space mogul. The battlefield awaits\u2014are you ready to make your mark?\u200b</p>","developers":["Deploy Starship LLC"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3796970/f32f58e0a11664135fb94b38832f926565d4c1d5/header.jpg?t=1753088912","is_free":true,"legal_notice":"All content owned by Deploy Starship LLC. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3796970/310898686/c0ebd251bd6a764497b15becf2d4d9284b0897f5/1753086250/dash_av1.mpd?t=1753088910","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3796970/310898686/c0ebd251bd6a764497b15becf2d4d9284b0897f5/1753086250/dash_h264.mpd?t=1753088910","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3796970/3108